WEBVTT

00:00:37.297 --> 00:00:40.163
"Maaaaaan ...

00:00:40.197 --> 00:00:42.697
You don't really let paint dry,"

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.963
one of my mentors said to me one day.

00:00:44.997 --> 00:00:46.630
He meant it as a compliment.

00:00:48.463 --> 00:00:50.297
"Yeah, I guess you're right,"

00:00:51.097 --> 00:00:53.797
I grinned back pseudo-shyly,

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:56.330
as I took said compliment
and placed it on my head

00:00:56.363 --> 00:00:57.897
like a half-cocked crown.

00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:01.830
I've always taken pride
in being the kind of artist